        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>Claw of the Panther.</em> You fire crystalline darts from your elbow.</p><p>Each creature in a 30-foot cone takes @Damage[2d6[piercing]] damage with a basic Reflex save. The area is littered with shards and becomes <strong>difficult terrain</strong> for enemies until the start of your next turn.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d6.</p><p><strong>Refined (9th)</strong> Your claws' damage die increases to <strong>1d10</strong>, and after using Garra de la Pantera you may <strong>Step</strong> as a free action.</p><hr /><p><em>Canon fires \"up to five\" darts; the cone abstracts them.</em></p>"
